	(text "DAC Output range is 0V to 4.096V (in high-gain mode)\nAnalog output range should be 0V to 10V\nRequire op-amp gain of 10/4.096=2.44\nNon-inverting topology gain is G= 1 + R_{F} / R_{g}\nChoose R_{F} = 14.3k , R_{g} = 10.0k\nSocket in Digikey: 1175-1475-ND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.934 184.404 0)
		(effects
			(font
